	<name>1974 Shattuck Ave · 599 units · Entitled · loop</name>
	<description><![CDATA[Standalone building loop, generated by scripts/gen_building_loop.py. Plan view 294 m -> spiral -> 1.2 turns -> eye level 108 m at radius 127 m. Altitudes derive from this building's extrusion height (98.0 m), so a corrected height re-cuts the shot. Load alongside geometry.kml.]]></description>
